### Health
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### List blocks
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/blocks

### Filter front room
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/blocks?room=Front&status=Open

### Create a block
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/blocks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "HB-D1",
  "name": "Beret Block D",
  "room": "Front Room",
  "headSizeCm": 56,
  "maxActiveHats": 2,
  "notes": "Soft crowns."
}

### Queue a hat
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/blocks/{{blockId}}/hats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Harbor Cloche",
  "client": "Nora Ellis",
  "material": "Felt",
  "style": "Cloche",
  "notes": "Match the navy grosgrain."
}

### Advance to wired
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/blocks/{{blockId}}/hats/{{jobId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Wired"
}

### Delete block
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/v1/blocks/{{blockId}}
